    where: The name of the practical information rows as one kind of block. A chip of the Kind Chips or Icon Tabs With Chips navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Practical info
    - lang: pt
      value: Informações práticas
  - key: kind_wall_locator
    where: The name of the strip showing where the point is on the wall as one kind of block. A chip of the Kind Chips or Icon Tabs With Chips navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Where it is
    - lang: pt
      value: Onde fica
  - key: kind_today_map
    where: The name of the map of the place today as one kind of block. A chip of the Kind Chips or Icon Tabs With Chips navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Map today
    - lang: pt
      value: Mapa atual
  - key: kind_related
    where: The name of the other points to see next as one kind of block. A chip of the Kind Chips or Icon Tabs With Chips navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Related
    - lang: pt
      value: Relacionados
  - key: kind_feedback
    where: The name of the feedback block as one kind of block. A chip of the Kind Chips or Icon Tabs With Chips navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Feedback
    - lang: pt
      value: Opinião
  - key: kind_nav_icon_grid
    where: The name of the icon grid block (a grid of the card's sections) as one kind of block.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Sections grid
    - lang: pt
      value: Grelha de secções
  - key: kind_nav_contents
    where: The name of the contents block (a list of the card's blocks with their minutes and a tick once read) as one kind of block.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Contents
    - lang: pt
      value: "\xCDndice"
  - key: kind_sources
    where: The name of the sources block as one kind of block. A chip of the Kind Chips or Icon Tabs With Chips navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Sources
    - lang: pt
      value: Fontes
  - key: nav_group_discover
    where: The name of the default navigation group that joins the About and Stories families. A segment of the Segmented navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Discover
    - lang: pt
      value: Descobrir
  - key: nav_group_watch
    where: The name of the default navigation group that joins the Media and Listen families. A segment of the Segmented navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Watch
    - lang: pt
      value: Ver
  - key: nav_group_explore
    where: The name of the default navigation group that joins the In AR and Play families. A segment of the Segmented navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Explore
    - lang: pt
      value: Explorar
  - key: nav_group_visit
    where: The name of the default navigation group that joins the Visit and Community families. A segment of the Segmented navigation shows it.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Visit
    - lang: pt
      value: Visitar
  - key: nav_more
    where: The last slot of the Bottom Bar when the card has more sections than Bar Slots; a tap on it
      lists the sections that did not fit.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: More
    - lang: pt
      value: Mais
  - key: nav_next_up
    where: The small line over the block the Up next bar points at (Bottom Bar = Up Next).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Up next
    - lang: pt
      value: A seguir
  - key: nav_next_up_position
    where: Beside it, which block of the card that is ({0} = its place, {1} = how many blocks
      the card has).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: '{0} of {1}'
    - lang: pt
      value: '{0} de {1}'
  - key: nav_next_button
    where: The button of the Up next bar that moves the card to the block it names.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Next
    - lang: pt
      value: Seguinte
  - key: nav_next_up_done
    where: What the Up next bar says at the card's last block, in place of a block and the Next
      button.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: You have reached the end
    - lang: pt
      value: Chegou ao fim
  - key: nav_menu
    where: The name of the menu button in the card's header and the title of the menu it opens over the card
      (the outline of the card's sections, or the big tiles).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Contents
    - lang: pt
      value: "\xCDndice"
  - key: nav_menu_by_purpose
    where: One side of the switch on the menu of big tiles; it shows the card's sections by what the visitor
      wants from them (About, Media, Stories...).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: By purpose
    - lang: pt
      value: Por objetivo
  - key: nav_menu_by_format
    where: The other side of the switch on the menu of big tiles; it shows the card's sections by how they are
      taken in (Read, Look, Watch, Listen...).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: By format
    - lang: pt
      value: Por formato
  - key: nav_menu_all
    where: The way back from one section's kinds of block to all the sections, on the menu of big tiles.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: All sections
    - lang: pt
      value: "Todas as sec\xE7\xF5es"
  - key: nav_fab
    where: The name of the round floating button above the card's top-right edge that opens the card's sections
      (as a list, or on an arc around it).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Sections
    - lang: pt
      value: "Sec\xE7\xF5es"
  - key: placed_model_remove
    where: The button on the small chip above the card while a model placed in the room stands, on the card of the
      point that placed it; it takes the model away.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Remove
    - lang: pt
      value: Remover
  - key: placed_model_other
    where: The small chip above another point's card while a model placed in the room stands; {0} is the name of
      the point whose model it is. A tap opens that point's card.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: "{0} is placed by the wall"
    - lang: pt
      value: "{0} est\xE1 junto \xE0 parede"
  - key: nav_contents_minutes
    where: Beside a row of the contents block and on a compact row, how long that block takes ({0} = whole minutes).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: "{0} min"
    - lang: pt
      value: "{0} min"
  - key: nav_contents_read
    where: What a row of the contents block is called once the visitor has had that block in view (read out with its tick, never shown
      alone).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Read
    - lang: pt
      value: Lido
  - key: nav_contents_section_read
    where: A section title of the contents block while its rows are folded under it (Rows = Sections First), beside its name ({0} = how
      many of its blocks the visitor has had in view, {1} = how many blocks it lists).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: "{0} of {1} read"
    - lang: pt
      value: "{0} de {1} lidos"
  - key: compact_meta
    where: The second line of a block shown as a compact row (display Expandable), when it gives its minutes ({0} = the block's format,
      e.g. Read; {1} = its time, e.g. 3 min).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: "{0} \xB7 {1}"
    - lang: pt
      value: "{0} \xB7 {1}"
  - key: compact_open
    where: The name of a collapsed compact row (its tooltip and accessible name, before the block's words) -- a tap opens the block in place.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Open
    - lang: pt
      value: Abrir
  - key: compact_close
    where: The name of an open compact row (its tooltip and accessible name, before the block's words) -- a tap closes the block again.
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Close
    - lang: pt
      value: Fechar
  - key: full_view_open
    where: The name of the button on an open compact row that shows the block in the full view over the card (tooltip and accessible name).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Open in full view
    - lang: pt
      value: "Abrir em ecr\xE3 inteiro"
  - key: nav_pager_position
    where: The Family Pager, the pages layout's header, under the name of the section shown ({0} = its place, {1} = how many sections
      the card has).
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: '{0} of {1}'
    - lang: pt
      value: '{0} de {1}'
  - key: nav_pager_previous
    where: 'The Family Pager''s left chevron (its name and tooltip): it moves the card to the section before the one shown.'
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Previous section
    - lang: pt
      value: "Sec\xE7\xE3o anterior"
  - key: nav_pager_next
    where: 'The Family Pager''s right chevron (its name and tooltip): it moves the card to the section after the one shown.'
    text:
    - lang: en
      value: Next section
    - lang: pt
      value: "Sec\xE7\xE3o seguinte"
